---
/** The Autopilot hero screen: the Quotation stage of one trip, in two
    states the card's switch flips between. Automation on — the engine has
    asked every qualified supplier at once, reminded the slow one and
    re-routed the decline; the choice is still a person's. Off — the same
    trip by hand, every line amber because every line is someone's to do. */
---
<div class="mk-panel wide">
  <div class="v v-auto">
    <div class="mk-head"><b>Quotation · Nairobi</b><small>Stage 3 of 9 · Automation on</small></div>
    <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk"></span><div><b>Rift Valley Ground Services</b><small>Request sent 09:02 · replied 09:41</small></div><span class="r">€4,180</span></div>
    <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk now"></span><div><b>Acacia Safari Logistics</b><small>No reply by 12:00 · reminder sent for you</small></div><span class="mk-tag grey">Waiting</span></div>
    <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk"></span><div><b>Karen Overland Co. → Mara Plains</b><small>Declined · re-routed to the next qualified supplier</small></div><span class="r">€4,505</span></div>
    <span class="mk-fine">Your margin goes on top of every reply. You choose; nothing is booked until you do.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="v v-manual">
    <div class="mk-head"><b>Quotation · Nairobi</b><small>Stage 3 of 9 · By hand</small></div>
    <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk hold"></span><div><b>Rift Valley Ground Services</b><small>You emailed on Tuesday · no reply yet</small></div><span class="mk-tag amb">Chase</span></div>
    <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk wait"></span><div><b>Acacia Safari Logistics</b><small>Not asked yet</small></div><span class="mk-tag amb">To do</span></div>
    <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk hold"></span><div><b>Karen Overland Co.</b><small>Declined · find another supplier yourself</small></div><span class="mk-tag amb">To do</span></div>
    <span class="mk-fine">Every line is yours: the asking, the chasing, the margin, the choice.</span>
  </div>
</div>
